            <span class="eyebrow">Graduate outcomes</span>
            <h2>Graduates with real skills, ready to go</h2>
            <ul class="outcome-list">
                <li><strong>Advocate for sovereignty</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Own and operate open systems</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Build on the open web</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Deploy sovereign AI</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Build for the physical and remote</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Deliver for real communities</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Be a professional</strong></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="lead">Plus a pathway to a future Level 6/7 qualification in resilient, applied computer engineering.</p>
